WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:30.499
People ask AI apps what to buy. Advertisers want to be in that moment, but there is no honest, disclosed way to be there.

2
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:45.499
A question is asked in an AI app. The answer is the app's own. The card below it is labelled Sponsored, and it is paid through a Solana payment channel only after the app signs that it inserted it.

3
00:00:45.500 --> 00:01:07.499
The saved record of one run: 4 questions, 15 agent decisions, 3 auctions, 3 signed deliveries. ClearVault and KeyForge funded 0.020 USDC each; LeatherGuard is unfunded.

4
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:29.499
ContextHint had seen this exact question before, next to an ad from Mercari. Agents get that history as evidence. Real brands are past observations, not bidders.

5
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:54.499
Decided with Jev. Without history ClearVault would have bid 0.003 USDC; with ContextHint history its intent rose from level 2 to 3, so it bid 0.004. One run, not a benchmark.

6
00:01:54.500 --> 00:02:19.499
Code, not the model, turns levels into a bid from a fixed table. ClearVault 0.004 and KeyForge 0.003 USDC: the highest bid won, so ClearVault paid 0.004 USDC.

7
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:44.499
An award is not a charge. The app inserts the labelled card and signs a receipt; only then is 0.004 USDC charged. These checks run in your browser when you open Verify.

8
00:02:44.500 --> 00:03:06.499
Asked again, ClearVault's agent said bid, but the frequency cap kept it out: a rule, not the agent. KeyForge won at 0.004 USDC. One question matched no campaign: zero agent calls, no ad, and the answer still served.

9
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:36.499
Small ads only work if each delivery is not its own transaction. Vouchers accumulate off-chain, 0.004 then 0.007 in total, and one close per channel pays 0.011 USDC in total on Solana Devnet.

10
00:03:36.500 --> 00:04:01.499
Verify recomputes 47 checks in your browser; change one byte of a receipt and two of them fail. Restarted with models off: zero new calls, charges or signatures. Not mainnet, not attention, not targeting lift.

11
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:15.500
Open Verify on this site and check every number yourself.
